@startuml Get_Class_Stats
hide footbox
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor white
}

title Sequence Diagram - Get Class Statistics

actor ":Instructor" as Instructor
participant ":Web Application" as Browser
participant ":InstructorController" as Controller
participant ":ClassStatsService" as Service
participant ":Database" as DB

Instructor -> Browser: 1. Select a class\nClick "View Statistics"
activate Browser

Browser -> Controller: 2. Send request to retrieve\nclass statistics
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: 3. Call GetClassStatsAsync(classId)
activate Service

Service -> DB: 4. Execute query:\nGet class with:\nClassEnrollments, Groups, Projects
activate DB
DB --> Service: 5. Return result
deactivate DB

Service -> DB: 6. Execute query:\nGet projects status:\nSubmittedProjects, PendingProjects\nApprovedProjects, RejectedProjects
activate DB
DB --> Service: 7. Return result
deactivate DB

Service -> DB: 8. Execute query:\nGet MilestoneEvaluations:\nCalculate average score\nCount evaluated projects
activate DB
DB --> Service: 9. Return result
deactivate DB

Service -> Service: 10. Calculate submission rate:\n= (SubmittedProjects / TotalProjects) * 100
Service -> Service: 11. Map to ClassStatsResponseDto:\nTotalStudents, TotalProjects\nSubmissionRate, AverageScore\nProjectDetails[]

Service --> Controller: 12. Return ClassStatsResponseDto
deactivate Service

Controller --> Browser: 13. Return 200 OK response
deactivate Controller

alt Response successful
    Browser -> Browser: 14. Process response data
    Browser --> Instructor: 15. Display statistics dashboard:\nSubmission rate chart, Average score\nProject status breakdown\nProject details table
else Response failed
    Browser --> Instructor: 15. Display error message
end
deactivate Browser

@enduml

